_at":"2026-03-05T13:49:25Z","git_url":"git://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch-net.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:elastic/elasticsearch-net.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch-net.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch-net","homepage":"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/client/net-api/current/index.html","size":611391,"stargazers_count":3654,"watchers_count":3654,"language":"C#","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1145,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":83,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["c-sharp","client","dot-net","dot-net-client","elasticsearch","elasticsearch-net","nest"],"visibility":"public","forks":1145,"open_issues":83,"watchers":3654,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"This meta ticket tracks the changes in Elasticsearch 7.8.0 that require changes in the client:\r\n\r\n### New APIs\r\n\r\n- [x] Cluster Delete VotingConfigExclusions \r\n- [x] Cluster Post VotingConfigExclusions \r\n\r\n#### Cluster Coordination\r\n- [x] Voting config exclusions should work with absent nodes [#50836](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/50836) (issue: [#47990](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/47990))\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Infra/Core\r\n- [x] Deprecate node local storage setting [#54374](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/54374)\r\n\r\n### New features\r\n\r\n#### Aggregations\r\n\r\n- [x] Add support for filters to T-Test aggregation [#54980](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/54980) (issue: [#53692](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/53692))\r\n- [x] Add Student's t-test aggregation support [#54469](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/54469) (issue: [#53692](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/53692))\r\n\r\n#### Features/Indices APIs\r\n- ~[ ] Add simulate template composition API _index_template/_simulate_index/{name}  [#55686](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/55686) (issue: [#53101](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/53101))~ Simulate index template APIs are experimental\r\n\r\n#### Geo\r\n\r\n- [x] Add new point field. [#53804](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/53804)\r\n\r\n\r\n### Enhancements\r\n\r\n#### Aggregations\r\n- [x] Expose agg usage in Feature Usage API [#55732](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/55732) (issue: [#53746](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/53746))\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Analysis\r\n- [x] Add preserve_original setting in ngram token filter [#55432](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/55432)\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Cluster Coordination\r\n- [x] Add voting config exclusion add and clear API spec and integration test cases [#55760](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/55760) (issue: [#48131](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/48131))\r\n\r\n#### Features/CAT APIs\r\n- ~[ ] Add support for V2 index templates to /_cat/templates [#55829](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/55829) (issue: [#53101](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/53101))~ v2 index template APIs are experimental\r\n\r\n#### Features/Indices APIs\r\n\r\n- ~[ ] Update template v2 api rest spec [#55948](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/55948) (issue: [#53101](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/53101))~ v2 index template APIs are experimental\r\n- ~[ ] Add prefer_v2_templates flag and index setting [#55411](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/55411) (issue: [#53101](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/53101))~ v2 index template APIs are experimental\r\n\r\n#### Features/Stats\r\n- ~[ ] Add Bulk stats track the bulk per shard [#52208](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/52208) (issues: [#47345](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/47345), [#50536](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/50536))~ Doesn't look to be in 7.8. See https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/52208#issuecomment-640999720\r\n\r\n#### Geo\r\n- [x] Doc values support for geo shapes. [ISSUE] [#37206](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/37206). NEST already implements `doc_values` for `GeoShapeProperty`\r\n\r\n#### Infra/REST API\r\n- ~[ ] Add validation to the usage service [#54617](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/54617)~ no client changes required\r\n\r\n#### Infra/Scripting\r\n- [x] Scripting: stats per context in nodes stats [#54008](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/54008) (issue: [#50152](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/50152))\r\n\r\n\r\n#### MULTIPLE AREA LABELS\r\n\r\n- [x] Add geo_shape mapper supporting doc-values in Spatial Plugin [#55037](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/55037) (issue: [#53562](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/53562))\r\n- ~[ ] Add pre-configured “lowercase” normalizer [#53882](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/53882) (issue: [#53872](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/53872))~ No client changes required\r\n\r\n#### Snapshot/Restore\r\n\r\n- ~[ ] Allow Deleting Multiple Snapshots at Once [#55474](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/55474)~ Change has been made to REST spec in master (https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/57326), but change will not be ported to 7.x\r\n\r\n#### Transform\r\n- [x] [Transform] add throttling [#56007](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/56007) (issue: [#54862](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/54862))\r\n\r\n### Bug fixes\r\n\r\n#### Aggregations\r\n\r\n- [x] Add analytics plugin usage stats to _xpack/usage [#54911](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/54911) (issue: [#54847](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/54847))\r\n\r\n#### Analysis\r\n\r\n- [x] Add preserve_original setting in edge ngram token filter [#55766](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/55766) (issue: [#55767](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/55767))\r\n\r\n#### Features/Ingest\r\n\r\n- [x] Fix empty_value handling in CsvProcessor [#55649](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/55649) (issue: [#55643](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/55643))\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch-net/issues/4718/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch-net/issues/4718/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"russcam","id":208231,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODIzMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208231?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/russcam","html_url":"https://github.com/russcam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/russcam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/russcam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/russcam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/russcam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/russcam/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/russcam/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/russcam/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/russcam/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/russcam/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-06-23T01:56:24